<title>USA: Friedman's names Victor Suglia CFO.</title>
<headline>Friedman's names Victor Suglia CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAVANNAH, Ga. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friedman's Inc, a retailer of fine jewelry, said on Wednesday that it has appointed Victor Suglia as senior vice president, chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Suglia joins Friedman's with over 20 years of retail experience, including 16 years with Saks Fifth Avenue, a unit of Saks Holdings Inc, where he was most recently vice president, corporate controller.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
